#speaker: NPC  
Whoa! Did you see that leaked video? It’s all over the internet!  

#speaker: Player  
What video?  

#speaker: NPC  
Some politician caught saying shady stuff. Everyone’s talking about it!  

* [Where did it come from?] -> AskSource  
* [That sounds serious. What did he say?] -> AskContent  
* [People doctor videos all the time. Are you sure it’s real?] -> QuestionAuthenticity  

=== AskSource ===  
#speaker: Player  
Where did it come from?  

#speaker: NPC  
Uh… some random account? Didn’t check.  

#speaker: Player  
Might be worth looking into before spreading it.  

#speaker: NPC  
…Yeah, I guess.  

-> END  

=== AskContent ===  
#speaker: Player  
That sounds serious. What did he say?  

#speaker: NPC  
Something about "handling things the way we always do." People think it’s a confession.  

#speaker: Player  
Or it could be out of context.  

#speaker: NPC  
Huh… never thought about that.  

-> END  

=== QuestionAuthenticity ===  
#speaker: Player  
People doctor videos all the time. Are you sure it’s real?  

#speaker: NPC  
I mean… no. I just saw the clip.  

#speaker: Player  
Maybe check a few sources before jumping to conclusions.  

#speaker: NPC  
Good idea. I’ll dig a little deeper.  

-> END  
